@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = 请先执行登录并复制data.token

### 1. 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. 登录（演示密码统一为123456）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "linxia",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 获取技能列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills?page=1&limit=9&type=offer&sort=popular

### 4. 获取当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 发布技能
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "offer",
  "title": "Express API 入门",
  "description": "一起完成一个包含路由、控制器和服务层的接口练习。",
  "locationType": "online",
  "coverUrl": ""
}

### 6. 获取个人统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 查看通知
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
